# BALLISTA bolt: a fast bolt of light shot by a Ballista (NpcSystem::fireBallistaBolt sets its team and velocity). Its
# body collides with the TERRAIN only (CollidesWith Terrain): it flies over the own walls and THROUGH the units, and stops
# in the ground (or runs out: Lifetime). Pierce: it hurts every enemy unit its flight passes, up to that many
# (GameProjectileComponent::update's swept test). HitsShadows: it is light, so a SHADOW (a demon that is not solid) takes
# its damage too. A small point light of its own. Replicated (Component Network).
Prefab gameBallistaBolt
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer gemsGlow
		Node Diamond
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.6 0.95 1
		Emissive 8
		Scale 0.16
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Layer Projectile
		CollidesWith Terrain
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.15
		Density 100
		ContactEvents true
	Component Light
		Light Point
			Color 0.6 0.95 1
			Intensity 15
			Range 5
	Component Network
	Component GameProjectile
		UnitDamage 45
		StructureDamage 0
		Lifetime 1.5
		Pierce 4
		HitsShadows true
